            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3 id="bugfixes">Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>修复没有候选词时，空格键被交由系统处理的问题 fix <a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/issues/195">#195</a> (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/a812f68a2b52a70df2771f4d44f858cbf645b582">a812f68</a>)</li>
<li>修复输入框中首个字符是数字，后输入的句号不会转为小数点的问题。fix <a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/issues/196">#196</a> (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/c17afc77910a5822c107d1bd009894c8b4d5cfbc">c17afc7</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="features">Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>debug (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/05e9793a6df9ec7a936b60ed32ea705288cd18b9">05e9793</a>)</li>
<li>支持自定义快捷键 (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/7a3aac4a7ceaf6b2f949382abbd13ad1e1c9dcb7">7a3aac4</a>)</li>
<li>调整“/”的默认映射方案为半角 <a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/issues/189">#189</a> (<a href="https://github.com/qwertyyb/Fire/commit/d17a34ef73d7539121a16b6988488e52c4810c5c">d17a34e</a>)</li>
</ul>
